			"othercredits"
			{
				"english"		"Compose & Lyrics & Mixing - Crimsona\r\n\r\nPlucked Strings - Ned Darlington\r\nViolin - Rosa Jang\r\nCello - Hyejeong Nam\r\nVocal - Elluna\r\nHang : Hoongu Jee\r\n\r\nNote: As Garden of Witches is currently in Early Access, new music and artists will continue to be added in the future."
				"french"		"Compose & Lyrics & Mixing - Crimsona\r\n\r\nPlucked Strings - Ned Darlington\r\nViolin - Rosa Jang\r\nCello - Hyejeong Nam\r\nVocal - Elluna\r\nHang : Hoongu Jee\r\n\r\nRemarque : Garden of Witches est actuellement en phase d'accès anticipé, et de nouvelles musiques par différents artistes seront ajoutées à l'avenir."
				"italian"		"Compose & Lyrics & Mixing - Crimsona\r\n\r\nPlucked Strings - Ned Darlington\r\nViolin - Rosa Jang\r\nCello - Hyejeong Nam\r\nVocal - Elluna\r\nHang : Hoongu Jee\r\n\r\nAttenzione: poiché Garden of Witches è attualmente in Accesso Anticipato, nuovi brani musicali e artisti continueranno a essere aggiunti in futuro."
				"german"		"Compose & Lyrics & Mixing - Crimsona\r\n\r\nPlucked Strings - Ned Darlington\r\nViolin - Rosa Jang\r\nCello - Hyejeong Nam\r\nVocal - Elluna\r\nHang : Hoongu Jee\r\n\r\nHinweis: Da sich Garden of Witches derzeit im Early Access befindet, werden auch in Zukunft neue Musik und Künstler hinzugefügt."
				"spanish"		"Compose & Lyrics & Mixing - Crimsona\r\n\r\nPlucked Strings - Ned Darlington\r\nViolin - Rosa Jang\r\nCello - Hyejeong Nam\r\nVocal - Elluna\r\nHang : Hoongu Jee\r\n\r\nNota: Como Garden of Witches está en acceso anticipado en estos momentos, en el futuro se irán añadiendo más música y artistas."
				"bulgarian"		""
